'''Sanyanians''' ({{Langx|kz|ߛߊߒߦߊߒߌߒߌ|Sanyanínì}}) are citizens of the island [[W:City-state|city-state]] of [[Sanyan]]. Sanyan is home to a people of a variety of origins, with the city-state itself being a [[W:Multiculturalism|multi-cultural]] country. Sanyanians of [[Olùkínza people|''Olùkínza'']], [[Imo Sanyanian|Imo]] and [[Ekwe Sanyanians|Ekwe]] descent have made up the overwhelming majority of the population since the 19th century. 

